Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:06.90,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}号下午 中网第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.90,0:00:09.90,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}反手接发敢抢 发球持续施压
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.90,0:00:10.85,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}丢盘以后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:14.01,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文怎样重新争回主动？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:20.45,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She tried, she made it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她尝试了 也打成了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.82,0:00:21.70,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}How about that?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这球真漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:24.02,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's paying off.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这招奏效了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:24.88,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Still in there.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还在继续周旋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:43.21,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}首盘第五局 她一局打出{\fs78}5{\fs68}个{\fs78}ACE{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.25,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}来到接发局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:46.95,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}底线相持仍要一拍一拍争
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:50.52,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}发球有威力 领先却还没稳稳拿住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:56.60,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, well done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:01:00.34,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Kalinskaya making quick work of the sixth game.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡林斯卡娅很快拿下第六局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:08.70,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well done.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:12.60,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And appreciation voiced by the crowd as they see{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N观众送上掌声 他们看到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:15.52,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Zheng dig her way out of a significant hole.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文终于从困境里扳了回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:25.32,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And too much to bear, as Kalinskaya…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N难以承受 卡林斯卡娅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.55,0:01:28.69,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 来到她的发球胜盘局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.99,0:01:32.19,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Right on the line.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N正好压线
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:46.69,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Zheng coughs up her serve, so the break lead…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文丢掉发球局 破发优势
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.15,0:01:50.70,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}领先被追回 双方一路打到抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:59.19,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, Anna Kalinskaya finds her way to a one-set lead.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 安娜 卡林斯卡娅先赢下一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:00.29,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Had to dig deep.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她也是拼尽全力才拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:01.71,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文赛后说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:04.14,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}调整心态需要一些时间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:07.55,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}次盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68} 她先面对两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.87,0:02:11.35,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, that's nice from Kalinskaya, as she appli…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N卡林斯卡娅打得不错 她施加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:28.74,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}守住这一局后 比分咬到{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:31.20,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}她再次拿到破发机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:42.46,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, and Kalinskaya, from 40–15 up…{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 卡林斯卡娅刚才还{\fs78}40{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.68,0:02:45.80,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 再一次来到她的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.54,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And that's how you close out a set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一盘 就该这样收下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:57.98,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}An emphatic hold at love for Zheng Qinwen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N郑钦文强势完成{\fs78}love{\fs68}保发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.32,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, did it find the line?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 这球压线了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:05.05,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}决胜盘首局后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:07.75,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}卡林斯卡娅接受医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.95,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}再打两局 她因身体不适退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.08,0:03:23.68,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}退赛前的已打部分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:26.91,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文{\fs78}13{\fs68}个{\fs78}ACE{\fs68} {\fs78}51{\fs68}记制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:29.36,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}非受迫失误也比对手多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:32.23,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}进攻有威力 也有代价
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.58,0:03:37.03,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}郑钦文下一轮将首次对阵鲍兹科娃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:38.75,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}你更希望她延续发球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:41.30,TL,,0,0,361,,{\an2}还是接发时的主动进攻？
